{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight as a frontline commander in SiegeBorn, where you lead the rebel force, fighting battle after battle to overthrow the tyrant king and free your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just giving commands from above \u2013 you're on the battlefield. Support your troops with your presence, assign tasks, or use destructive siege engines. Whether it's a castle siege or an open-field battle, every encounter is fast, physical, and destructive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for physics-based chaos: walls break, trees fall, siege machines blow up, and soldiers fly through the air in full ragdoll style. You\u2019ll need to act fast - the battle has already begun, and there\u2019s no time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead from the front</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of your commander and change the course of battle in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use siege engines</strong> \u2013 Control catapults, ballistas, battering rams, and more. All physics-based and fully destructible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give tactical orders</strong> \u2013 Command your squads on the fly: attack, defend, follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based </strong>\u2013 Destroy walls, crush enemy lines, and watch ragdoll soldiers fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized medieval visuals</strong> \u2013 Clean top-down perspective with epic large-scale battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle through handcrafted missions as you rise against a tyrant king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mode</strong> \u2013 Defend your fortress against endless waves of enemies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672670?t=1751873159","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672670?t=1751873159","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/46215799d7d8888685cb88959bdb446b2248dfe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751873159","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/46215799d7d8888685cb88959bdb446b2248dfe8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751873159","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/d61c7e37565617f65f583b9fd6183e0e.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight as a frontline commander in SiegeBorn, where you lead the rebel force, fighting battle after battle to overthrow the tyrant king and free your land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not just giving commands from above \u2013 you're on the battlefield. Support your troops with your presence, assign tasks, or use destructive siege engines. Whether it's a castle siege or an open-field battle, every encounter is fast, physical, and destructive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/3f39b89a570284c3c776c947427cb273.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for physics-based chaos: walls break, trees fall, siege machines blow up, and soldiers fly through the air in full ragdoll style. You\u2019ll need to act fast - the battle has already begun, and there\u2019s no time to waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.poster.avif?t=1751873159\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.webm?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/extras/aedfb44b68e93d90aa0cb175c7b44225.mp4?t=1751873159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead from the front</strong> \u2013 Take direct control of your commander and change the course of battle in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use siege engines</strong> \u2013 Control catapults, ballistas, battering rams, and more. All physics-based and fully destructible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give tactical orders</strong> \u2013 Command your squads on the fly: attack, defend, follow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based </strong>\u2013 Destroy walls, crush enemy lines, and watch ragdoll soldiers fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized medieval visuals</strong> \u2013 Clean top-down perspective with epic large-scale battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Singleplayer campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle through handcrafted missions as you rise against a tyrant king.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival mode</strong> \u2013 Defend your fortress against endless waves of enemies.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Prince Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672670/ec824624c80801b48859af4571bdcee85287f4eb/header.jpg?t=1751873159","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672670/874140/9bbf0838419637c73fee5cc92689c06376a103f6/1750397309/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745195853","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672670/874140/9bbf0838419637c73fee5cc92689c06376a103f6/1750397309/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745195853","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3672670/874140/9bbf0838419637c73fee5cc92689c06376a103f6/1750397309/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745195853","id":257128479,"name":"SiegeBorn","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128479/da07303a03114570c251c28db9ad35f808c2266f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745195853"}],"name":"SiegeBorn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or ATI DirectX9 Compatible Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li>